commit 71ca8b33
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:37:58 -0600
subject: fix(security): add path validation to Cursor auto-import route (GAP-P1-12)

- Import realpath and lstat from fs/promises
- Add validateCursorDbPath() function that:
  * Rejects paths containing '..' or null bytes
  * Resolves symlinks via realpath()
  * Validates resolved path is under allowed Cursor directories
  * Builds allowed prefixes from homedir() for each platform
- Wire validation into GET handler after dbPath is found
- Update tests to mock realpath/lstat (partial - some tests need refinement)

This closes the symlink/traversal attack vector where an attacker
could place a symlink at a Cursor config location to redirect
sqlite3/better-sqlite3 to open arbitrary files.

Security impact: HIGH - prevents arbitrary file read via symlink
Performance impact: MINIMAL - one realpath() call per request

